OL,3,GNEWSAMusic co-op to re-open after
OL,4,Asecuring #100k
OL,5,
OL,6,FA music co-operative in north
OL,7,FLancashire will re-open after being
OL,8,Fclosed for six years following the
OL,9,Faward of a #90,000 grant.
OL,11,FLancaster Music Co-op's (LMC) building
OL,12,Fon Lodge Street was forced to close in
OL,13,F2021 after the building was declared
OL,14,Funsafe.
OL,16,FInitial repairs worth #1.2m were funded
OL,17,Fby grants and a community fundraising
OL,18,Fcampaign, but an extra #100,000 was
OL,19,Fneeded.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
