OL,5,
OL,6,FThe money has now been secured through
OL,7,Fthe Arts Council England grant, which
OL,8,Fwas dependent upon #10,000 in
OL,9,Fmatch-funding the co-op has raised
OL,10,F"thanks to the generosity of the local
OL,11,Fcommunity".
